yle="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.19;margin-bottom:12pt;margin-top:0pt;">NON-CONTROLLING INTERESTS</p></td></tr></table><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;line-height:1.19;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">In November 2020, the Company&#8217;s subsidiary, 1 Pharmacy Technology issued <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_8kIglIy9PkmtCXnmRXzcEA" contextRef="Duration_11_1_2020_To_11_30_2020_dei_LegalEntityAxis_yi_YaofangMember_OP0b07i8F0OYEVF0GQsGpA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardSharesIssuedInPeriod" scale="0" id="Narr_JyA_pM4KlkaDsyy_jr9oQQ">32,500,000</ix:nonFraction> ordinary shares to 13 LLPs founded by the employees of 1 Pharmacy Technology with the total consideration of RMB <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_CNY_eLIlXpzezkeI9ErqwFtpng" contextRef="Duration_11_1_2020_To_11_30_2020_dei_LegalEntityAxis_yi_YaofangMember_OP0b07i8F0OYEVF0GQsGpA" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsVestedInPeriodTotalFairValue" scale="3" id="Narr_Jjh-o2jbZEy3Mny4Lr2KRw">32,500</ix:nonFraction>. With full shareholders&#8217; rights of these ordinary shares issued to the LLPs, these shares are accounted as non-controlling interest of 1 Pharmacy Technology. The shares issued to the employees in each LLP are not outstanding shares but are restricted with <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_uVtV7QW_90GfInde3yRR7A" contextRef="Duration_11_1_2020_To_11_30_2020_us-gaap_VestingAxis_yi_VestingWithinTwoYearsMember_GoRStIHTT0CbArh5XdBQ8A" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRightsPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_SUIdTAtqpEu4LQFscZyhkw">50</ix:nonFraction>% of the shares vesting within two years from the issuance date and the remaining <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_uVtV7QW_90GfInde3yRR7A" contextRef="Duration_11_1_2020_To_11_30_2020_us-gaap_VestingAxis_yi_VestingOverTwoYearsThereafterMember_EuKzUA_Yd0aZMoSaBtCYDg" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingRightsPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_uTeBm3SQJEiZAmzgGLK1gw">50</ix:nonFraction>% vesting evenly on an annual basis over the 2 years thereafter, which are also subject to adjustment based on performance condition. Such arrangement was entered into to provide a share incentive plan to the employees of 1 Pharmacy Technology (&#8220;Employee ownership plan of 1 Pharmacy Technology&#8221;). Share-based compensation was recognized over the vesting period based on the excess of the fair value of these shares over the issuance price (see Note 14). In 2024 and 2025, the Company&#8217;s subsidiary, Shanghai Yiyao Supply Chain Management Co., Ltd., repurchased <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_8kIglIy9PkmtCXnmRXzcEA" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_12_31_2024_srt_ConsolidatedEntitiesAxis_yi_ShanghaiYiyaoSupplyChainManagementCoLtdMember_srt_OwnershipAxis_yi_OnePharmacyTechnologyShanghaiCoLtdMember_2ar6xYdvREuKCb62kor1Iw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockRepurchasedDuringPeriodShares" scale="0" id="Narr_TPWxiwtjQkGZXbH1yaovpA">13,521,445</ix:nonFraction> and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_8kIglIy9PkmtCXnmRXzcEA" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_srt_ConsolidatedEntitiesAxis_yi_ShanghaiYiyaoSupplyChainManagementCoLtdMember_srt_OwnershipAxis_yi_OnePharmacyTechnologyShanghaiCoLtdMember_5ZhHbYUNoEKmGiDpDvJP-Q" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockRepurchasedDuringPeriodShares" scale="0" id="Narr_ZS7OvB5trkGOy9l6E_hrzg">1,863,987</ix:nonFraction> ordinary shares, respectively of 1 Pharmacy Technology for cash consideration of RMB<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_CNY_eLIlXpzezkeI9ErqwFtpng" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_12_31_2024_srt_ConsolidatedEntitiesAxis_yi_ShanghaiYiyaoSupplyChainManagementCoLtdMember_srt_OwnershipAxis_yi_OnePharmacyTechnologyShanghaiCoLtdMember_2ar6xYdvREuKCb62kor1Iw" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockRepurchasedDuringPeriodValue" scale="3" id="Narr_zTDaZSYPDUiAU827X5-qcg">13,521</ix:nonFraction> and RMB<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_CNY_eLIlXpzezkeI9ErqwFtpng" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_srt_ConsolidatedEntitiesAxis_yi_ShanghaiYiyaoSupplyChainManagementCoLtdMember_srt_OwnershipAxis_yi_OnePharmacyTechnologyShanghaiCoLtdMember_5ZhHbYUNoEKmGiDpDvJP-Q" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockRepurchasedDuringPeriodValue" scale="3" id="Narr_PVk7P0dv_EWPoBzeBmJycg">1,864</ix:nonFraction>, respectively, at cost from departed employees and in connection with unvested options. Repurchased shares were reserved from reissuance to employees based on performance conditions.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;line-height:1.19;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt;">Non-controlling interest (&#8220;NCI&#8221;) was recognized at RMB<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_CNY_eLIlXpzezkeI9ErqwFtpng" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_12_31_2024_us-gaap_StatementEquityComponentsAxis_us-gaap_NoncontrollingInterestMember_CsrPmkuc70mMUQeUwig2IQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="yi:CapitalContributionFromNonControllingShareholders" scale="3" id="Narr_p-dGDQSaikOTv8dFfuqR1A">2,935</ix:nonFraction> and RMB<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_CNY_eLIlXpzezkeI9ErqwFtpng" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_us-gaap_StatementEquityComponentsAxis_us-gaap_NoncontrollingInterestMember_NItZp_fYYkua1QLTPUhhbw" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="yi:CapitalContributionFromNonControllingShareholders" scale="3" id="Narr_LLyGs_6mkkuT4QJyhh9Xsg">3,339</ix:nonFr