ksky6NtvgqA9P4A">4,094</ix:nonFraction> was recorded as net loss attributable to the NCI shareholders.</p></ix:nonNumeric><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:12pt;line-height:1.19;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_JyCgLQNgl0-s-szOGxcVqg" name="us-gaap:StockholdersEquityNoteDisclosureTextBlock" id="Tb_UvPh1eWe_UKe6SvXYFvyVA" escape="true"><table style="border-collapse:collapse;border:0;"><tr><td style="vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.19;margin-bottom:12pt;margin-top:0pt;">12.</p></td><td style="padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.19;margin-bottom:12pt;margin-top:0pt;">ORDINARY SHARES</p></td></tr></table><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;line-height:1.19;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Each Class A ordinary share entitles the holder to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_Vote_584yKGxujUCRHeuXQXeE3Q" contextRef="Duration_9_1_2018_To_9_30_2018_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_CommonClassAMember_us-gaap_StatementEquityComponentsAxis_us-gaap_CommonStockMember_HBsHGi09A0K9lriWb43R6Q" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="yi:CommonStockNumberOfVotes" scale="0" id="Narr__hmHDLpZT0WnDT2sqfqqKw">one</ix:nonFraction> vote, and each Class B ordinary share entitles the holder to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_Vote_584yKGxujUCRHeuXQXeE3Q" contextRef="Duration_9_1_2018_To_9_30_2018_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_CommonClassBMember_us-gaap_StatementEquityComponentsAxis_us-gaap_CommonStockMember_riS2l1E8DUeH-xHo7NJJEQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="yi:CommonStockNumberOfVotes" scale="0" id="Narr_-8xrj2iyy0magDriONLNyA">fifteen</ix:nonFraction> votes on all matters subject to the vote at general meetings of the Company. Both Class A ordinary shares and Class B ordinary shares are entitled to the same dividend right, as such, this dual class share structure has no impacts to the earnings per share calculation. Basic earnings per share and diluted earnings per share are the same for each Class A ordinary share and Class B ordinary share. In September 2018, <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_8kIglIy9PkmtCXnmRXzcEA" contextRef="Duration_9_1_2018_To_9_30_2018_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_CommonClassAMember_us-gaap_StatementEquityComponentsAxis_us-gaap_CommonStockMember_HBsHGi09A0K9lriWb43R6Q" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesConversionOfConvertibleSecurities" scale="0" id="Narr_wO9d7LMDoEeiOh6F17eGLg">75,118,996</ix:nonFraction> former preferred shares were converted into Class A ordinary shares and the Company issued <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_8kIglIy9PkmtCXnmRXzcEA" contextRef="Duration_9_1_2018_To_9_30_2018_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_CommonClassAMember_us-gaap_StatementEquityComponentsAxis_us-gaap_CommonStockMember_HBsHGi09A0K9lriWb43R6Q" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" scale="0" id="Narr_1LFUw7niFk-rlJXVn_pAcA">15,969,110</ix:nonFraction> Class A ordinary shares with the completion of the IPO. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;line-height:1.19;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On January 25, 2019, <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_8kIglIy9PkmtCXnmRXzcEA" contextRef="Duration_1_25_2019_To_1_25_2019_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_CommonClassAMember_us-gaap_StatementEquityComponentsAxis_us-gaap_CommonStockMember_HIB5efGlj06GuQLBygYJ0Q" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" scale="0" id="Narr_hVnpYEXvykyVsNWKnPf3NQ">5,500,000</ix:nonFraction> Class A ordinary shares were issued to the Company&#8217;s depositary bank, Bank of New York Mellon (&#8220;BNYM&#8221;), for bulk issuance of ADSs reserved for future issuances restricted stocks upon the exercise of stock options or vesting of restricted stocks under the 2013 Share Incentive Policy, 2014 Share Incentive Policy, 2016 Share Incentive Plan and 2018 Share Incentive Plan (together, the &#8220;Plans&#8221;). From August 15, 2019 to August 14, 2020 and from September 6, 2021 to September 5, 2022, the Company repurchased a total of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_8kIglIy9PkmtCXnmRXzcEA" contextRef="Duration_9_6_2021_To_9_5_2022_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_CommonClassAMember_us-gaap_StatementEquityComponentsAxis_us-gaap_CommonStockMember_Ka3XxBSSrEmp8IUGpWceoQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockRepurchasedDuringPeriodShares" scale="0" id="Narr_wUPyjw6o8EmtGEBM47CdVA"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_8kIglIy9PkmtCXnmRXzcEA" contextRef="Duration_8_15_2019_To_8_14_2020_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_CommonClassAMember_us-gaap_StatementEquityComponentsAxis_us-gaap_CommonStockMember_6PknjDTYqUGszQjIPYyWWg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockRepurchasedDuringPeriodShares" scale="0" id="Narr_dBxnxjSvvkWI8YtowbR7_w">2,330,620</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction> Class A ordinary shares of the Company and the repurchased shares were transferred to Computershare Hong Kong Investor Services Ltd. (&#8220;Computershare&#8221;), also for future issuances upon the exercise of stock options or vesting of restricted stocks under the Plans.</p></ix:nonNumeric><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_JyCgLQNgl0-s-szOGxcVqg" name="us-gaap:RevenueFromContractWithCustomerTextBlock" id="Tb_37JYJviR7Eq_PVosXPmScA" continuedAt="Tb_37JYJviR7Eq_PVosXPmScA_cont1" escape="true"><table style="border-collapse:colla