in:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;"><i style="font-style:italic;">Employee Share options</i></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;line-height:1.19;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;">The options granted have a contractual term of <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_EmployeeStockOptionMember_ipbaC6YZ10ygu39taHZibw" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardExpirationPeriod" id="Narr_UJmH5hwqikGe9Utr5GmcVA">10 years</ix:nonNumeric> and generally vest over a <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_EmployeeStockOptionMember_ipbaC6YZ10ygu39taHZibw" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingPeriod1" id="Narr_qRGrlQuiQkCLjLIgg8shWg">four-year</ix:nonNumeric> period, with vesting schedules:&#160;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_uVtV7QW_90GfInde3yRR7A" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_EmployeeStockOptionMember_ipbaC6YZ10ygu39taHZibw" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="yi:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingPercentagePerYear" scale="-2" id="Narr_ebNvYYwZj0aB6iWensw1UA">25</ix:nonFraction>% of the awards vesting on the anniversary of the grant date each&#160;year.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;line-height:1.19;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;">On October 27, 2022, the Board of directors of the Company has resolved, effective December 31, 2022 (the &#8220;Effective Date&#8221;), the exercise price per share of each option that is outstanding and not exercised, canceled, forfeited, or surrendered immediately prior to the effective Date, whether vested or unvested, shall be amended to USD <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_8nTMgju5WEaqwH0Xzx5wvA" contextRef="As_Of_10_27_2022_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_EmployeeStockOptionMember__x6qiBira0qh6N1GPW7ptA" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsVestedAndExpectedToVestExercisableWeightedAverageExercisePrice" scale="0" id="Narr_zRsWM4WN3Ui41qZrEpvfRg">0.01</ix:nonFraction> per Share. All other terms of the share options granted remain unchanged. As of December 31, 2022, there were <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_item_gb6wQ1jk5k61x-h1fxu0sA" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2023_To_12_31_2023_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_EmployeeStockOptionMember_9tmnY_MAfkydf30JgOUcQw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="yi:NumberOfGranteesAffectedForIncrementalCost" scale="0" id="Narr_yiGZ5E-mJ06fG0Bglry4XQ">51</ix:nonFraction> grantees affected with the incremental cost of RMB <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_CNY_eLIlXpzezkeI9ErqwFtpng" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_srt_TitleOfIndividualAxis_srt_BoardOfDirectorsChairmanMember_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_EmployeeStockOptionMember_hImlyQy0HEyOKJl4HSTC_A" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsAggregateIntrinsicValueOutstanding" scale="3" id="Narr_wZF7NbKlbkufZOgNGE6ESA">42,100</ix:nonFraction> for vested options to be recognized as compensation expenses immediately and the incremental cost of RMB <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_CNY_eLIlXpzezkeI9ErqwFtpng" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_EmployeeStockOptionMember_U7T8IB46pE6t36CicMV88w" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsAggregateIntrinsicValueOutstanding" scale="3" id="Narr_lIMjZ_6kskWLXYim1DkuXg">6,652</ix:nonFraction> for unvested options to be recognized over the remaining vesting period, ranging from 2022 to 2025.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;line-height:1.19;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;">The Black Scholes model was applied in determining the estimated fair value of the options granted. The model requires the input of subjective assumptions. The following table presents the assumptions used to estimate the fair values of the share options granted for the&#160;year ended December 31, 2021. The Company did not grant options during the years ended December 31, 2023, 2024 and 2025.</p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_JyCgLQNgl0-s-szOGxcVqg" name="us-gaap:ScheduleOfShareBasedPaymentAwardStockOptionsValuationAssumptionsTableTextBlock" id="Tb_dZkNCbVRQUeUr7j4Jj6OcQ" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:12pt;min-height:0.0pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:0pt;line-height:1.19;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-size:16pt;height:max-content;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;width:100%;"><tr style="height:1pt;"><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:82.93%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="bottom:0pt;position:absolute;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:12pt;line-height:1.19;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div></div></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.74%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="bottom:0pt;position:absolute;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:12pt;line-height:1.19;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div></div></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:14.32%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1